# Rith, Liberated Primeval: "At the beginning of your end step, if a creature
# or planeswalker an opponent controlled was dealt excess damage this turn,
# create a 4/4 red Dragon". Its CheckSVar is Count$NumDamageThisTurn Card
# Creature.OppCtrl+wasDealtExcessDamageThisTurn,... (AbilityUtils.java:
# 2434-2450): the turn's damage records, each target matched as it was when
# dealt the damage, with its batch's excess outcome (CardDamageTable.java:130).
# Craw Wurm (6/4) is blocked by ai's Grizzly Bears (2/2): 4 excess. The Bears
# die at end of combat; at human's end step the record still names an
# opponent's creature dealt excess damage, so the Dragon is made.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 2
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 3=2
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
advance 3
resolvestack
